            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Close Issue 71 before running completion checks**\n\nAlthough the handoff was corrected, this newly added summary still tells the integrator to close Issue 71 only after the completion merge and main checks; following this evidence makes the required pre-merge `run-program-lifecycle-gate.py`/`make verify` fail because `validate_completion_issues` requires a completion-transition issue to already be `closed` with `state_reason=completed`. The same stale ordering also appears in `test-results/README.md`, so update all current instructions to close the issue before validating the completion candidate.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L369-L371](https://github.com/ElectricDogCN/Guize/blob/9c6e26a9bb9ba7720c8569a4a2d35eddbaa67e8f/AGENTS.md#L369-L371)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
